---
description: Fork maintainer rules and the AI disclosure footer
alwaysApply: true
---

Before writing a GitHub issue, comment, pull request, review, release note, or upstream draft, read `skills/maintainer/SKILL.md`.

Every agent-produced artifact ends with:

`_AI disclosure: drafted by an AI agent (<agent name>) for @mrjoshuap._`

Agent commits carry `Assisted-by: Grok Bot (<role>)` only, plus `Co-authored-by` when a platform hook appends it. Agents never sign off as Joshua. The merger adds `Signed-off-by: mrjoshuap <5722442+mrjoshuap@users.noreply.github.com>` in the squash-merge message at merge time. Leave the PR template AI disclosure and Attestation checkboxes unticked.
